WEBVTT

00:00:28.441 --> 00:00:30.568
(Laughter)

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:31.819
Yeah.

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:35.156
Yeah, I think that's where we're at.

00:00:35.198 --> 00:00:36.699
(Laughter)

00:00:37.742 --> 00:00:41.454
No, but I do hate when people say
that God is a woman, right?

00:00:41.454 --> 00:00:42.663
I hate that.

00:00:42.663 --> 00:00:45.249
I really, I think she would have
done better, you know?

00:00:45.249 --> 00:00:46.417
No.

00:00:46.459 --> 00:00:48.127
(Laughter and applause)

00:00:48.586 --> 00:00:51.089
It's like, if God is a woman,
she's a real guy's gal,

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:52.632
if you know what I mean?

00:00:54.926 --> 00:00:56.094
(Laughter)

00:00:56.844 --> 00:00:59.013
I'm going to do a couple
songs for you guys.

00:00:59.764 --> 00:01:05.186
So this first one I wrote before lockdown,
but it became especially relevant.